    Each view has one route (PRD-APP-221). The "beforeLoad" function of
    each route checks the session and the roles of the view (PRD-APP-222).
    The loader of a list route and of a detail route fills the query cache
    with the query options of the entity slice (PRD-APP-223). Data: "app"
    (a dsml.generate.react_app.AppData). -#}
